# Curation scratch. `content-pipeline.md` §2 calls it disposable, and it is: contact
# sheets, raw downloads and candidate metadata for pictures nobody has chosen yet. What
# survives curation is copied into the pack's own media/ by pack-import-media.
packs/*/.candidates/

# Spike and pipeline OUTPUT — regenerable, large, and third-party media under mixed
# licences. `docs/design/` records what was measured from it; the bytes stay local.
samples/

